    "name": "No Survivors",
    "steam_appid": 3500350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is so much conflict and division in the world\u2014there\u2019s only one hope for unity, and it starts with you, the first zombie. In <i>No Survivors</i>, you\u2019re not just an ordinary undead; you\u2019re an antihero on a mission to deliver the cure before humanity gets in its own way. With only 30 minutes on the clock, you must dash through a chaotic urban environment, balancing reckless mayhem with razor-sharp tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you carve your path toward a government facility developing the zombie cure, every decision counts. Unleash your inner tactician by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Upgrading on the Fly:</strong> Each fallen foe drops precious gems that fuel a dynamic, card-based leveling system. Choose from three upgrade cards at every level-up\u2014with a dash of randomness that might force you to improvise your perfect build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2022 <strong>Meta-Progression &amp; Horde Building:</strong> Devour the brains of downed NPCs to earn meta-experience and convert them into loyal horde members. Later, invest your hard-won brains in a  talent tree to unlock potent abilities and boost your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Tactical Chaos:</strong> The more carnage you create, the higher your wanted level rises\u2014drawing in relentless law enforcement that will stop at nothing to bring you down. Switch to an overhead view at any time to issue orders to your growing horde, orchestrating a balance between individual might and collective strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh opportunity to perfect your strategy\u2014whether you\u2019re a casual player reveling in the absurdity of being a \u201cgood\u201d zombie or a hardcore tactician fine-tuning your build for maximum carnage. Will you brave the ticking clock and master the art of controlled chaos, or will the relentless forces of law and order finally catch up with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is so much conflict and division in the world\u2014there\u2019s only one hope for unity, and it starts with you, the first zombie. In <i>No Survivors</i>, you\u2019re not just an ordinary undead; you\u2019re an antihero on a mission to deliver the cure before humanity gets in its own way. With only 30 minutes on the clock, you must dash through a chaotic urban environment, balancing reckless mayhem with razor-sharp tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/4c47eda7eb8d7328d47592b0158b7f44.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you carve your path toward a government facility developing the zombie cure, every decision counts. Unleash your inner tactician by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Upgrading on the Fly:</strong> Each fallen foe drops precious gems that fuel a dynamic, card-based leveling system. Choose from three upgrade cards at every level-up\u2014with a dash of randomness that might force you to improvise your perfect build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/8f45d0c922477fa6aeec9d59ca9a999c.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2022 <strong>Meta-Progression &amp; Horde Building:</strong> Devour the brains of downed NPCs to earn meta-experience and convert them into loyal horde members. Later, invest your hard-won brains in a  talent tree to unlock potent abilities and boost your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/f0032acea1b7951a37c821e561142a65.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Tactical Chaos:</strong> The more carnage you create, the higher your wanted level rises\u2014drawing in relentless law enforcement that will stop at nothing to bring you down. Switch to an overhead view at any time to issue orders to your growing horde, orchestrating a balance between individual might and collective strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/c5ecd6e798019d09157f491fe05907de.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh opportunity to perfect your strategy\u2014whether you\u2019re a casual player reveling in the absurdity of being a \u201cgood\u201d zombie or a hardcore tactician fine-tuning your build for maximum carnage. Will you brave the ticking clock and master the art of controlled chaos, or will the relentless forces of law and order finally catch up with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.poster.avif?t=1751147553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.webm?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500350/extras/d85167d3f23a00fe3746b68deb129110.mp4?t=1751147553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "No Survivors is a fast-paced action game where you become the alpha zombie on a 30-minute race through a chaotic city. Collect gems to upgrade your abilities, recruit and direct a horde, and tactically outmaneuver relentless law enforcement to deliver the cure to humanity's woes.",
